  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Multi-Sector Assistance and Improved Access to Basic Services for Internally Displaced Persons (IDPs) Living in Protracted Displacement in Iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With this project, IOM contributes to improved and dignified living conditions and increased access to services of populations affected by displacement through life-saving assistance to address humanitarian needs of internally displaced persons in Iraq. IOM will implement multi-sector camp coordination and camp management response in remote or underserved informal settlements hosting vulnerable IDPs in protracted displacement, unable or prevented to return in the short term.</narrative>
  </description>
